     "titre": "Austria: NISG 2026 applies from 1 October 2026 – registration by 31 December 2026",
     "resume": "The WKO notes that NISG 2026 (NIS2 transposition, published in the BGBl on 23 December 2025) applies from 1 October 2026, replacing NISG 2018: risk management and incident reporting become mandatory. Entities must register with the Federal Cybersecurity Office by 31 December 2026 and submit a self-declaration by 30 September 2027; registration arrangements and some requirements are still to be set by regulation. Fines up to EUR 10m or 2% of global turnover (essential entities)."
