     "titre": "MHRA: draft Medical Devices (Amendment) Regulations 2026 notified to the WTO",
     "resume": "The MHRA published on 8 May 2026 (WTO notification) the draft regulation reforming the UK medical device and IVD framework, with an impact survey open until 19 June 2026. It provides international reliance routes (US, Canada, Australia, not the EU), a new IMDRF-aligned IVD classification, explicit cybersecurity requirements for software and predetermined change control plans (PCCP); adoption is expected in late 2026, with transitional periods (5 years announced for IVDs)."
